// Chores for Mrs. Sato, one per afternoon, in order: the stairwell, the
// rooftop garden, walking Mochi (Luna is in the park once Kai has met her),
// the recycling, the crooked shelf. Each pays $15.
//
// Lines: chore k at k01..; the park with Luna at 311..

str cho101a
    en "The stairs, Kai. All three floors. Dust is the enemy."
str cho102a
    en "Forty minutes and one broom later, the stairwell shines."
str cho103a
    en "Perfect! Fifteen dollars. Don't spend it all on coffee."
str cho104a
    en "(...I am absolutely going to spend it on coffee.)"

str cho201a
    en "Water my tomatoes, please. And talk to them. They grow better."
str cho202a
    en "Hello, tomatoes. You're looking very... red. Keep it up."
str cho203a
    en "From the roof he can see the whole bay, and the corner of the Moonbean's sign."

str cho301a
    en "Mochi needs her walk. Twice around the park, and no treats!"
str cho302a
    en "Mochi drags Kai twice around the pond at full speed. Someone on a bench waves at the dog. Kai is too out of breath to notice."
str cho311a
    en "On a bench by the pond, someone is sketching. A girl with a chestnut ponytail."
str cho312a
    en "Mochi! And... Kai? You walk Mochi?"
str cho313a
    en "For money. Mrs. Sato pays me. Mochi pays me in sneezes."
str cho314a
    en "Ha! I come here on my breaks. Mochi always says hi."
str cho315a
    en "They walk one more lap together. Mochi approves."

str cho401a
    en "Bottles, cans, paper. Separate! The city fines me if you mix them."
str cho402a
    en "Kai sorts the recycling for an hour and learns more about his neighbours than he ever wanted to know."
str cho403a
    en "Good boy. Here you go."

str cho501a
    en "That shelf. It has been crooked since 1998. Fix it."
str cho502a
    en "...Done! It's straight."
str cho503a
    en "It is not straight. Mrs. Sato pays him anyway, smiling."

ui sChore modal=false
    if dlg::line == 101
        text cho101a pos=252,827 width=1440 tint=1,0.96,0.9,1
    if dlg::line == 102
        text cho102a pos=252,827 width=1440 tint=0.78,0.86,1,1
